flowchart TB
  Browser --> RSC[Next.js RSC / Action / Route Handler]
  RSC --> DAL[Server-only DAL]
  DAL --> A[Actor/tenant/ABAC policy]
  A --> TX[Drizzle transaction + set_config tenant]
  TX --> RLS[(PostgreSQL RLS)]
  RLS --> DTO[Authorized DTO]
  DTO --> Browser
  Worker[Temporal Activity with delegated principal] --> A
  Worker --> Gate[Tool/model egress gate]
  Gate --> Approved[Approved external effects]
